1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Dictionaries map keys to values with average O(1) lookup.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Use dict.get(key, default) when a missing key should not raise KeyError.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Contradictory claim for eval: append on a list is always O(n), never amortized O(1).

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
JSON serialization uses json.dumps; keep API payloads schema-validated.
